  "kind": "story",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "聖靈之塔淪陷,死亡骷髏團長「狙」現身"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "呼!一路都沒休息的趕來,真是累死人了...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 13,
              "speaker_name": "貝克威"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-13",
          "text": "希望我們還來得及。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 14,
              "speaker_name": "珊"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-14",
          "text": "這裡好像是平日的聚會場所,不過為何充滿了血腥味...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 3,
              "speaker_name": "哈瓦特"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-3",
          "text": "啊!前面好像是敵方的大軍,精靈族人被圍在中間!...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "不要做白日夢了!我寧可葬身於此,也不願作你們的俘虜!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "狙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/5",
          "text": "老頭子,識時務者為俊傑,我的雇主很需要像你這樣法力高強又見識廣博的大法師,如果你願意投降,我保證他不會虧待你的。呵呵呵...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "少囉唆了!精靈族可不是貪生怕死的種族,來一決勝負吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 23,
              "speaker_name": "羅蘭"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-23",
          "text": "有我在此,你們休想碰長老一根汗毛!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "狙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/8",
          "text": "既然你們不肯跟我走,我就只好把你們的屍體帶回去了..給我殺!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "可惡!又是「死亡骷髏」!...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "看來聖靈之塔已經落入敵手,剩下的精靈族人正在做最後的頑抗..沒辦法,我們先保住他們的性命,再作其他的打算!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "狙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/11",
          "text": "又有其他的傻瓜來了嗎?好極了,我正嫌這些精靈太少,殺起來不過癮呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 6,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-6",
          "text": "瑪..瑪爾!原來是妳!沒想到妳還活著.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "狙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/13",
          "text": "哦,是禁衛軍的隊長大人啊!遺憾的很,「死亡骷髏」當年是被你們剿滅了,但我花了好幾年的時間又把它重建起來,現在的「死亡骷髏」已非昔日所能比了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 6,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-6",
          "text": "早知如此,當時就不該好心放妳逃走的...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "狙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/15",
          "text": "是嗎?那時沒有追殺到底是你自己的疏忽,也好,我們順便清算一下當年的帳....你們都別想活著離開這裡!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "這種為錢賣命的惡棍,何必和他們囉唆!我們上吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/0"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "浴血決戰,團長真身現形——萊汀舊識瑪爾"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 16,
              "speaker_name": "凱拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-16",
          "text": "唔..我還不能倒下..還沒..奪回..聖靈之塔...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 17,
              "speaker_name": "米亞斯多德"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-17",
          "text": "..神啊..請保佑我們精靈族..戰勝黑暗之力...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": -1,
              "speaker_name": "狙"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "speaker": "legacy/speaker/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/2",
          "text": "終於來了嗎!宰了這些傢伙!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "..哼,小伙子們還真有一手啊....敗在你們手裏,我沒什麼話好說了.."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 6,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-6",
          "text": "瑪爾!..如果那時妳改過向善,就不會有今天的結果!..為什麼...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 26,
              "speaker_name": "聖寇拉斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-26",
          "text": "..萊汀,我對你說過,我的身上流著罪犯的血液,我們是注定不能並肩作戰的..你以後可以放心了....唔...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 6,
              "speaker_name": "萊汀"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-6",
          "text": "瑪爾...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "我本來以為這回死定了,還好你們前來支援,我們才能戰勝這個殺手集團,真是非常感激。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "幸好我們還趕得及,想必這是神的旨意。聖靈之塔的情形如何?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "三天前就已經被敵人攻入了,為了減少無謂的死傷,我就命令所有守軍撤退,所以那裡的情形現在我也不很清楚。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "我明白了。此外,我先前請你進行的調查可有結果?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "我在王城的大圖書館中花了三個月研究古代典籍,還在各地的遺跡中進行挖掘,結果只得到了這支法杖和一點結論。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "嗯,真是支很奇異的法杖....結論怎麼說呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "根據古典籍的記載,有關你所說的「天空之鑰」,事實上是由一個黃金徽章和五顆魔法寶石所構成的,這六樣東西必須經由這法杖的魔力才能結合在一起,從而發出及強大的力量,據說這力量可以克服時間和空間的限制,將使用者移動到遙遠的未知地方去。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "很有趣的說法!你的結論呢?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "那有什麼結論!這六件東西,早在八百年前就不知道都失落到哪裡去了,而當我開始試圖要尋找它們的蹤跡時,黑暗軍就對亞述森林發動了攻擊,我只好先中斷了這段研究。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1/lines/16",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "我一直相信天空之鑰和這一連串事端有關,既然你暫時無法完成研究,這個揣測也就只好作罷,我們得換一個新的調查方向...."
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/1"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "決議直赴巨塔(未鑄成天空之鑰)"
