      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/2/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "為了避免敵人在塔中玩出什麼花樣,我們還是先消滅掉塔中的敵人再說,以免夜長夢多。羅蘭,為了增強戰力起見,妳也和我一起去吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 23,
              "speaker_name": "羅蘭"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/2/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-23",
          "text": "是的,長老!善後工作交給其他人就可以了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/2/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "好,那我們即刻前往巨塔!事關緊要,大家稍事休息就馬上出發!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/2/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "沒問題!我們這就上路吧!"
        }
      ],
      "scene_id": "legacy/scene/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/2"
    },
    {
      "beats": [],
      "extensions": {
        "legacy": {
          "label": "希爾法鑄成傳說法器「天空之鑰」"
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/0",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "等等!希爾法大師,你所說的徽章和寶石,是不是這些?...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/1",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "啊!蘊含光、闇、火焰、冰和星星之力的五顆寶石....就是這個沒錯!你們怎麼找到這些東西的?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/2",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "路上逐一得來的,敵人似乎也對它們感興趣,所以其中幾個費了好大勁才到手。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/3",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "好極了,我現在就試試這支法杖管不管用。大家讓開一些,這可能會有些危險...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/4",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "未知的遠古神祇啊,履行契約的時刻到了,請給予這法杖以失落的力量,讓被遺忘的道路再次開啟...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/5",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "馬那德拉、亞布利加、艾米西德拉、伊多卡那瓦!...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/6",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "瞧,完成了!相信這就是你一直在找的「天空之鑰」!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/7",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "真令人不敢相信,我花了十幾年尋找的東西,竟然就這樣到手了,這是命運的安排吧...."
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 4,
              "speaker_name": "亞雷斯"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/8",
          "speaker": "character/native-4",
          "text": "約拿先生,這個「天空之鑰」有什麼特別的用途?"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/9",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "我只知道它與古代人的傳說有關,據說它可以打開往天空的道路,至於是用怎樣的方式,就沒有人知道了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/10",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "哎,好失望,我還以為這下子可以飛上天空了呢!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 21,
              "speaker_name": "約拿"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/11",
          "speaker": "character/native-21",
          "text": "索爾,別急,我相信我們真正的敵人必定與這天空之鑰有關,我們遲早可以解開這個秘密..以及悠妮小姐的來歷之謎。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/12",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "真的嗎?..那我就放心了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 24,
              "speaker_name": "希爾法"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/13",
          "speaker": "character/native-24",
          "text": "雖然如此,為了避免敵人在塔中玩出什麼花樣,我們還是馬上動身前往巨塔,其他的事以後再說!羅蘭,為了增強戰力起見,妳也和我一起去吧!"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 23,
              "speaker_name": "羅蘭"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/14",
          "speaker": "character/native-23",
          "text": "是的,長老!善後工作交給其他人就可以了。"
        },
        {
          "extensions": {
            "legacy": {
              "speaker": 0,
              "speaker_name": "索爾"
            }
          },
          "line_id": "legacy/line/9bd82ef4e817/scenes/3/lines/15",
          "speaker": "character/native-0",
          "text": "好!我們這就出發囉!"
        }
      ],
